{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"18d605b76ce0ce8b7896c55a048971d827e454f0d479e5d953f3671430cf12f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以色列人哪，你們全家是我從埃及地領上來的，當聽耶和華攻擊你們的話："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"在地上萬族中，我只認識你們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我必追討你們的一切罪孽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["先知的任務"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"二人若不同心，豈能同行呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"獅子若非抓食，豈能在林中咆哮呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少壯獅子若無所得，豈能從洞中發聲呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若沒有機檻，雀鳥豈能陷在網羅裏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"網羅若無所得，豈能從地上翻起呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城中若吹角，百姓豈不驚恐呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"災禍若臨到一城，豈非耶和華所降的嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華若不將奧祕指示他的僕人－眾先知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就一無所行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"獅子吼叫，誰不懼怕呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華發命，誰能不說預言呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["撒馬利亞的結局"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"要在亞實突的宮殿中","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和埃及地的宮殿裏傳揚說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要聚集在撒馬利亞的山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就看見城中有何等大的擾亂與欺壓的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些以強暴搶奪財物、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"積蓄在自己家中的人","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不知道行正直的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以主耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人必來圍攻這地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的勢力衰微，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"搶掠你的家宅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和華如此說：「牧人怎樣從獅子口中搶回兩條羊腿或半個耳朵，住撒馬利亞的以色列人躺臥在床角上或鋪繡花毯的榻上，他們得救也不過如此。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"主耶和華－萬軍之上帝說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當聽這話，警戒雅各家。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我討以色列罪的日子，也要討伯特利祭壇的罪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"壇角必被砍下，墜落於地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要拆毀過冬和過夏的房屋。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"象牙的房屋也必毀滅；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高大的房屋都歸無有。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}